1. Assets: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
--------------------------

  games/duckparade/art/     the sprite sheets, tiles and title logo, and
                      art/incoming/TODO.md (the art briefs)
  games/duckparade/docs/    pictures of the game (docs/screenshots/)
  games/duckparade/DESIGN.md the design document
  music and sound     any music or sound file added to
                      games/duckparade/ (today the music and
                      sounds are made by code:
                      tools/make_music.py and src/sfx.c, MIT)

The art in art/ is drawn by code (tools/make_art.py, MIT); the drawn
sheets themselves are assets under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.

